OL,3,GNEWSA'I interviewed PM and danced
OL,4,Athrough Number 10'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn influencer has spoken of his
OL,7,F"surreal" visit to Downing Street to
OL,8,Finterview the prime minister and mimic
OL,9,Fthe famous dance from the film Love
OL,10,FActually.
OL,12,FLuke Hamnett, who has about 1.3 million
OL,13,Ffollowers on TikTok, spoke to Andy
OL,14,FBurnham at Number 10 for an episode of
OL,15,Fhis Live, Laugh, Luke podcast.
OL,17,FThe pair covered a mixture of topics,
OL,18,Fincluding music, tattoos, Larry the
OL,19,FCat, the NHS, the cost of living crisis
OL,20,Fand the safety of the LGBTQIA+
OL,21,Fcommunity.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
