OL,3,GNEWSA'I interviewed PM and danced
OL,4,Athrough Number 10'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHamnett, from Stoke-on-Trent, said he
OL,7,Fwas "very proud" to have spoken to
OL,8,FBurnham "about causes and subjects
OL,9,Fclose to my heart".
